# November 25, 2026: Lawrence and Eudora, Douglas County, Kansas. A third pass over Douglas County, which already had the
# trail, territorial and downtown sites (data_ks_kwud.py, data_ks_pmvt.py). This one adds the houses and one district the
# first two left out. Sources: National Register nomination forms (text from the National Park Service's NPGallery, read with
# page.py), the Kansas Historical Society's register summaries for Douglas County, and Wikipedia read with wiki_raw.py.
# Coordinates are ArcGIS street-address points checked on the Kansas 2024 aerial. Nothing seen on the ground.
